    <string name="medical_pregnant">⚠️ Prenatal Exercise Safety</string>
    <string name="medical_pregnant_body">Exercise during pregnancy has many benefits but some movements carry risks. Please consult your OB/GYN before starting. Stop immediately if you experience abdominal pain, bleeding, or unusual fetal movement.</string>
    <string name="medical_elderly">⚠️ Safety Note for Older Adults</string>
    <string name="medical_elderly_body">Some exercises may carry risk for those with osteoporosis or arthritis. Consult your doctor first and ensure support is nearby. Stop if you feel dizzy or have severe joint pain.</string>
    <string name="medical_cardiac">⚠️ Cardiovascular Condition Notice</string>
    <string name="medical_cardiac_body">Exercise benefits heart health but high-intensity activity carries risks. Exercise under medical supervision. Stop and call emergency services if you experience chest pain or palpitations.</string>
    <string name="medical_rehab">⚠️ Rehabilitation Notice</string>
    <string name="medical_rehab_body">This app\'s content is for reference only and cannot replace professional rehabilitation guidance. Please use with your medical team\'s approval.</string>
    <string name="medical_disabled">⚠️ Adaptive Fitness Notice</string>
    <string name="medical_disabled_body">Choose movements carefully based on your specific situation, ideally with professional guidance.</string>
    <string name="medical_youth">⚠️ Notice for Users Under 18</string>
    <string name="medical_youth_body">Teenagers\' bones are still developing. Please use this app with guidance from a parent or PE teacher.</string>
